hpc:Cluster a owl:Class .
hpc:OpenapiClustersResp a owl:Class .
hpc:OpenapiClustersRemovedResp a owl:Class .

hpc:hasSchema a owl:ObjectProperty .

hpc:OpenapiClustersResp rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Cluster .
hpc:OpenapiClustersRemovedResp rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Cluster .

hpc:hasSchema rdfs:domain hpc:Cluster ;
                 rdfs:range rdf:Resource .
```

This ontology fragment defines two classes `hpc:Cluster`, `hpc:OpenapiClustersResp`, and `hpc:OpenapiClustersRemovedResp`. It also declares an object property `hpc:hasSchema` that connects a `hpc:Cluster` to its schema. The domain of `hpc:hasSchema` is `hpc:Cluster`, and its range is `rdf:Resource`.
